@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam ArrowColor #1F2A44
skinparam componentBorderColor #1F2A44
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #1F2A44
skinparam packageBorderColor #8090A8
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Loading : start / resume
Loading --> Waiting : full batch received
Waiting --> Loading : 2 s spacing passed
Loading --> Complete : short batch (last)
Loading --> Stopped : Stop (request aborted)
Waiting --> Stopped : Stop
Stopped --> Loading : Resume
Loading --> Backoff : 429, 5xx, network
Backoff --> Loading : delay or Retry-After passed\n(at most 2 retries)
Backoff --> Paused : retries used up
Loading --> Paused : later batch timeout
Loading --> TooBroad : first batch timeout,\nor 502/504 after retries
Paused --> Loading : Retry
TooBroad --> Loading : Try again or\nrelationship chosen
Complete --> [*]
@enduml
